    {
      "role": "entry",
      "url": "https://test.listly.io/en/",
      "html": "<main class=\"catalog-page\"> <header class=\"catalog-hero\"><div><h1>What would you like to learn?</h1><p>Practice the features you need on realistic sample sites.</p></div><span class=\"catalog-total\">18 collection and tool examples</span></header> <section id=\"extension\" class=\"catalog-group catalog-start\"><div class=\"catalog-group-heading\"><h2>Four ways to collect</h2></div><div class=\"catalog-grid catalog-basics\"> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/whole-extraction\" data-case=\"whole-extraction\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/whole-extraction.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/whole-extraction-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Whole extraction</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Turn a list into a table with one click</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">10 products · One page</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/partial-extraction\" data-case=\"partial-extraction\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/partial-extraction.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/partial-extraction-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Partial extraction</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Collect only the areas you choose</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">10 products · Select an area</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/tabs-extraction\" data-case=\"tabs-extraction\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/tabs-extraction.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/tabs-extraction-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Tabs extraction</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Collect pages already open in tabs</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">3 practice tabs · Same area</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/deep-extraction\" data-case=\"deep-extraction\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/deep-extraction.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/deep-extraction-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Deep extraction</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Follow links to the details inside</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">12 products · Detail pages</span> </div> </a> </div></section> <section class=\"catalog-group\"><div class=\"catalog-group-heading\"><h2>For different situations</h2></div><div class=\"catalog-grid\"><a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/table-data\" data-case=\"table-data\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/table-data.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/table-data-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Table data</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Keep empty cells in the right columns</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">12 courses · Empty cells and columns</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/pagination/basic\" data-case=\"pagination/basic\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/04_pagination_basic.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/04_pagination_basic.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Pagination type 1</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Navigate numbered links</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">100 products · 10 pages</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/infinite-scroll\" data-case=\"infinite-scroll\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/01_infinite-scroll.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/01_infinite-scroll.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Infinite scroll</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Keep collecting newly loaded items</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">200 products · 10 added at a time</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/dynamicdata\" data-case=\"dynamicdata\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/06_dynamic_data.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/06_dynamic_data.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Virtual scroll</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Collect before items disappear</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">200 products · 10 replaced at a time</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/loadbutton\" data-case=\"loadbutton\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/02_load_more.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/02_load_more.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Load more clicks</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Collect by clicking the button repeatedly</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">100 products · 10 added at a time</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/pagination/type1\" data-case=\"pagination/type1\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/12_pagination_type_01.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/12_pagination_type_01.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Pagination type 2</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Click numbered buttons</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">60 articles · 12 pages</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/pagination/type2\" data-case=\"pagination/type2\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/13_pagination_type_02.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/13_pagination_type_02.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Pagination type 3</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Move to the next group of page numbers</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">100 reviews · 20 pages</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/pagination/type4\" data-case=\"pagination/type4\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/15_pagination_type_04.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/15_pagination_type_04.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Pagination type 4</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Use previous and next buttons</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">120 tracks · 12 pages</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/pagination/letters\" data-case=\"pagination/letters\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/pagination/letters.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/pagination/letters-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Pagination type 5</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Navigate lettered buttons</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">60 studios · 12 pages, A–L</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/iframe-pagination\" data-case=\"iframe-pagination\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/iframe-pagination.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/iframe-pagination-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>iframe pagination</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Automatically turn pages inside an embedded frame</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">100 reviews · 20 pages</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/shadow-products\" data-case=\"shadow-products\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/shadow-products.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/shadow-products-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Shadow DOM</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Collect information inside isolated components</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">100 products · 10 pages</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/iframe\" data-case=\"iframe\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/07_iframe.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>iframe</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Collect from a page embedded inside another</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">5 articles · Embedded news</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/url-builder\" data-case=\"url-builder\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/url-builder.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/url-builder-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>URL Builder</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Generate addresses by changing the number</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">1001–1005 · Practice with 5 pages</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/image-downloader\" data-case=\"image-downloader\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/image-downloader.svg\" data-animation=\"/static/images/tutorial-features/image-downloader-motion.svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Image Downloader</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Save collected image URLs with your own filenames</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">Demo coming soon</span> </div> </a> </div></section> <section id=\"server\" class=\"catalog-group\"><div class=\"catalog-group-heading\"><h2>Let the server handle large or recurring collections</h2><span>Demo coming soon</span></div> <div class=\"catalog-grid\"><a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/lazyloading\" data-case=\"lazyloading\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/03_lazy_loadiing.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/03_lazy_loadiing.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Wait time</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Collect after the list has loaded</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">Demo coming soon</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/require-login\" data-case=\"require-login\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/05_Login.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/05_Login.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Auto login</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Sign in before collecting details</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">Demo coming soon</span> </div> </a> <a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/en/device-type\" data-case=\"device-type\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/08_device_type.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Device settings</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Collect the mobile version</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">Demo coming soon</span> </div> </a> </div> </section> <section id=\"actions\" class=\"catalog-group\"><div class=\"catalog-group-heading\"><h2>When basic settings are not enough</h2><span>Action Script · Advanced options · Demo coming soon</span></div><div class=\"catalog-grid\"><article class=\"feature-card feature-pending\" data-case=\"popup\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/11_popup.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/11_popup.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Action Script</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Close popups</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">Demo coming soon</span> </div> </article> <article class=\"feature-card feature-pending\" data-case=\"popover\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/10_popover.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/10_popover.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Action Script</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Reveal on click</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">Demo coming soon</span> </div> </article> <article class=\"feature-card feature-pending\" data-case=\"pagination/type3\"> <div class=\"case-thumbnail\"><img src=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/14_pagination_type_03.png\" data-animation=\"/static/images/listlyFeatures/14_pagination_type_03.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"280\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <div class=\"feature-copy\"> <h2>Action Script</h2><p class=\"feature-function\">Switch tabs</p> <span class=\"feature-summary\">Demo coming soon</span> </div> </article> </div></section> <footer class=\"catalog-footer\"><p>This site uses practice data.</p><details><summary>About these tutorials</summary><p>Practise collecting web data with Listly. Follow interactive tutorials for whole, partial, tabs and deep extraction, pagination, infinite scroll and table data.</p><a href=\"https://www.listly.io/en/\">Listly</a></details></footer> </main>"
